OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 20 APR
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Haydn
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod explores how his
OL,6,     Gemployer's obsession for opera
OL,7,     Gfuelled his own musical growth,
OL,8,     Gdespite a catastrophic fire.
OL,9,G1700FIn Tune
OL,10,     GLive music from pianist Chloe
OL,11,     GFlower and Simon Armitage reads
OL,12,     Ghis new poem celebrating the
OL,13,     G200th anniversary of London Zoo.
OL,14,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,15,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,16,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
